00:26:51,357 --> 00:26:52,960
They ask simple questions.

859
00:26:53,140 --> 00:26:54,556
Did we spend what we planned?

860
00:26:54,736 --> 00:26:56,210
Did anything surprise us?

861
00:26:56,390 --> 00:26:58,269
Is there a subscription or fee we

862
00:26:58,269 --> 00:26:58,724
can cut?

863
00:26:58,904 --> 00:27:01,013
Is our savings rate going up or

864
00:27:01,013 --> 00:27:01,354
down?

865
00:27:01,704 --> 00:27:02,412
Once a year,

866
00:27:02,412 --> 00:27:03,887
they do a bigger checkup.

867
00:27:04,067 --> 00:27:07,713
Insurance policies, beneficiaries on retirement accounts,

868
00:27:07,713 --> 00:27:08,928
the investment mix,

869
00:27:08,928 --> 00:27:10,719
and goals for the next year.

870
00:27:10,899 --> 00:27:13,817
Many also review their tax situation before

871
00:27:13,817 --> 00:27:14,767
the year ends,

872
00:27:14,767 --> 00:27:17,821
looking for things like maxing out retirement

873
00:27:17,821 --> 00:27:18,771
contributions.

874
00:27:18,951 --> 00:27:21,756
These annual reviews catch problems before they

875
00:27:21,756 --> 00:27:22,771
become expensive.

876
00:27:23,120 --> 00:27:24,619
And whenever they get a raise,

877
00:27:24,619 --> 00:27:25,918
they follow a simple rule.

878
00:27:26,098 --> 00:27:28,021
Before any lifestyle upgrade,

879
00:27:28,021 --> 00:27:30,475
they increase their automatic saving.

880
00:27:30,655 --> 00:27:32,865
Many save at least half of every

881
00:27:32,865 --> 00:27:33,279
raise.

882
00:27:33,459 --> 00:27:35,212
That single habit is one of the

883
00:27:35,212 --> 00:27:37,192
most powerful ways to build wealth,

884
00:27:37,192 --> 00:27:39,681
because your lifestyle never catches up with

885
00:27:39,681 --> 00:27:41,830
your income, and the gap keeps growing

886
00:27:41,830 --> 00:27:42,735
year after year.

887
00:27:43,085 --> 00:27:44,687
Finally, many give.

888
00:27:44,867 --> 00:27:46,763
Studies of wealthy households,

889
00:27:46,763 --> 00:27:48,216
and Stanley's research,

890
00:27:48,216 --> 00:27:51,122
found that many millionaires give regularly to

891
00:27:51,122 --> 00:27:52,512
