896
00:27:59,469 --> 00:28:00,669
not the goal itself.

897
00:28:01,018 --> 00:28:02,202
A word of warning.

898
00:28:02,382 --> 00:28:04,759
When people see a routine like this,

899
00:28:04,759 --> 00:28:07,137
