900
00:28:07,137 --> 00:28:07,665
day one.

901
00:28:07,845 --> 00:28:08,760
Up at five,

902
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:09,924
no coffee out,

903
00:28:09,924 --> 00:28:12,586
no TV, side project every night,

904
00:28:12,586 --> 00:28:14,416
reading an hour a day.

905
00:28:14,596 --> 00:28:16,407
By Friday, they've quit.

906
00:28:16,587 --> 00:28:19,049
Big overnight changes rarely last.

907
00:28:19,229 --> 00:28:21,882
Small changes that stack up over months

908
00:28:21,882 --> 00:28:22,630
