917
00:28:38,079 --> 00:28:39,716
Start with the free ones.

918
00:28:40,066 --> 00:28:42,267
And the third mistake is comparing your

919
00:28:42,267 --> 00:28:44,919
chapter one with someone else's chapter twenty.

